  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Protection Services and Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration for Vulnerable and Stranded Migrants in Algeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the present action is to contribute to effective migration management in Algeria by increasing the availability of protection, return and reintegration services for vulnerable and stranded migrants. The proposed response will provide assisted voluntary return and reintegration and protection services to a total of 100 stranded and/or vulnerable migrants in Algeria.</narrative>
  </description>
